OL,7,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales are on
OL,8,Ftheir first official visit to Bute,
OL,9,FScotland
OL,11,FAs part of their trip, William and
OL,12,FCatherine watch and play shinty - our
OL,13,Freporter takes you through the
OL,14,Ftraditional sport
OL,16,FEarlier, opening a summit in Ayrshire,
OL,17,Fthe King warned tech bosses of the
OL,18,F"existential dangers" of AI falling
OL,19,Finto the wrong hands
